en:
Everyone had finished telling their stories.
But the seventh one still hadn't come.
Maybe something came up today and they couldn't make it.{p}

"Yeah, guess so."
Shindo got up from his seat too.
One after another, everyone else started getting ready to leave.{p}

"Thanks for everything.
You did a good job."
"Yes!"{p}

"Ah, never mind, I was just talking to myself.
See ya!"
"Okay..."{p}
